{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cea81c2babfd4720c432548d0156fa60b97a9b4a60b2c56ea6a560fe69cdb115", "ja": "おっ、3人ともそろってるな！\nごめん、ツアーの打ち合わせが長引いちゃって……", "zh": "哦，3人都到齐了啊！  \n抱歉，巡演的讨论拖得有点久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "bc4e77e6407e004b7c8b2f83de56da665396ef3fa2d64a5a518fd7a82fdcab61", "ja": "おはようございます。", "zh": "早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "b578e324468235fbe4051090c5580d0eb07601770bc21fc1acb94d8ea9a21655", "ja": "おはようございます！", "zh": "早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "29a7af3e8ad4515a03d8027a8754769297e3e463eed4feec9403f739612d0661", "ja": "おはようございますー！", "zh": "早上好——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4e6a08bc87bbe62147f244590efcd2d15f6b3803791700c8cc2a311ecc4762c8", "ja": "うわビックリした！\nすごい反応速度だな……？", "zh": "哇吓我一跳！\n好惊人的反应速度啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "f0becf0c5a604b6b1b5dd09b7d7b06e84008a7495bccb9b2301db36da73be9f9", "ja": "はい、ちょうど何があってもすぐ反応できるよう、\n気を引き締めているところでした！", "zh": "是的，我正好在集中精神，以便无论发生什么都能立刻做出反应！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "ee920c0fdcd058fbc9b452c74c7f6d95f3d97e5f984214c0a318c789efe988b0", "ja": "常在戦場と申します。仲間がツアーに出ている今、\n留守を預かる私達こそ、万全の心構えが必要かと。", "zh": "常言道“常在战场”。正因同伴们如今正外出巡演，\n留守大本营的我们，才更需要做好万全的心理准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "87e25402d314f73a099f5137ce3b0fdc9e2fef35b9ae52da3ae919c027e8d41b", "ja": "留守番の子がしっかりしてないと、\n外で安心して働けないですもんね！", "zh": "负责留守的孩子要是不可靠，外出的人也没法安心工作嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "093ef2f8f937ed57e45c23c28b864c0a826c50062aec0fab9cbbb580de8b2294", "ja": "さすがですわね。でもご安心くださいまし、\nわたくしも奈緒も同じ気持ちですの。", "zh": "不愧是您。不过请放心，我和奈绪也是同样的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "68ca07a34f2c6b476127945c57fbedcefc7c2f96cd003508be6cfad4bf278f4b", "ja": "ミーティング用の飲み物、全員分持ってきたで～。\nこれからこのメンツで、新しい仕事の話やんな？", "zh": "我把开会要喝的饮料，大家的份都带来了哦～。\n接下来就是要和大家一起聊新工作的事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1010_p", "source_sha256": "66e698e18d8837dca1aa41682abdc8857cdcca36d19bdf4836fabc4f7cffed39", "ja": "そうなんだ。みんな、『ミックス＆リエゾン音楽祭』\n……通称『ミリ音』って知ってるか？", "zh": "是这样啊。大家知道“Mix & Liaison音乐节”吗？\n……也就是俗称的“百万音乐节”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "96871aee891afd82b8cd0be052a9246cee85f5925588c8a63cec8026db0b6662", "ja": "あれ、それって……かなり大きな音楽フェスですよね？\n最近アニソンとかもやるようになって……。", "zh": "咦，那个不是……规模相当大的音乐节吗？\n最近也开始加入动漫歌曲了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "d3cbe09083963aadc0717f7cf302327ccd421a9799e6e3b2366de21f30b1d04b", "ja": "ああ、私もTVで見たことあるわ。\nって！　私らアレに出れるんですか！？　すごいやん！", "zh": "啊，我也在电视上看过。\n等等！我们能参加那个吗！？太厉害了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d81d88f521b2fb02ff5e45d5af253219b80c010742f21cef93965f0aeafe3373", "ja": "うん、出演オファーが届いた！　でも、ちょっと\n問題があって……ほら、今ツアー中だろ？", "zh": "嗯，出演邀请已经送来了！不过，有点问题……你看，我们现在正在巡演吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2f193d252ce4481bfb357ca182ff32c52fc7862e9f949a81833600ebaf847934", "ja": "日程がどん被りで、俺は当日、\nこっちは途中から駆け付けになりそうなんだ。", "zh": "日程撞得正着，我当天恐怕只能赶到这边的活动现场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "2cbb7f508b3b1307d6dbaac76aa712342246d9228e5972a57bdd2ea23e48fadb", "ja": "では私達だけで、『みり音』の大舞台に\n臨むことになる……ということですね。", "zh": "那么，也就是说，要由我们独自登上『みり音』的大舞台……对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "1dee56d910c15fe87a4b65261c9e347f26d010645dc3b9a01e0d52c4b135ebbd", "ja": "そっか……。で、でも大丈夫です、いけます！　私達\nは私達でちゃんとしなきゃ。ですよね、やよいさん？", "zh": "这样啊……。不过、不过没关系，我们能行！我们也得做好自己的事才行。对吧，弥生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "ba34198e42b5e836b5e3d2bd098449f4ea4383afaa2544a83d5ce712461c3816", "ja": "はいっ、{$P$}もツアー中のみんなも\n安心してお仕事できるように、頑張りましょー！", "zh": "好的！为了让{$P$}和巡演中的大家都能安心工作，我们一起加油吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "0347bd77d4cb1d53ae5ea15ce7f72279bac7b4a0ce916ea719518ea783d268d8", "ja": "お～、なんやメッチャ気合い入ってんなぁ。\nほな、問題はなんもなかったってことで♪", "zh": "哦～，怎么干劲这么足啊。\n那么，就当作什么问题都没有吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "ca69efbe0a882f8eb1bdfb69b359ac452456e93d9679613b3bdf3870ed7077ef", "ja": "そうですわね。実は{$P$}も\n最初からこうなると思っていたのではありませんこと？", "zh": "是这样呢。其实，{$P$}先生也不是从一开始就觉得会变成这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a6332b006a7a3638da041bddb2f3a0fec9ef8f879eb4b3202e3848d27b353a22", "ja": "いえ、そこまでは……まあ、信じてはいましたけど。\nみんなになら、任せても大丈夫だろうって。", "zh": "不，倒也没想得那么远……不过，我确实一直相信着大家。\n相信交给你们的话，肯定没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "b675999c5be1f5af51688adff477ef7ec6d5d262da1c2b01f877401093139418", "ja": "ふふっ、真、いけずなお方です。そのような言葉を\nいただいては……お応えしないわけには参りません。", "zh": "呵呵，真，您可真会捉弄人呢。既然您都这样说了……我也不能不答应。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1022_008tak", "source_sha256": "e7d4a6203dd6bcefbb5e3654b20fb6f3a87281fee019ce72dc59d49905464ce0", "ja": "ご安心ください。{$P$}の留守は、\n必ずや私達がお守りいたしましょう。", "zh": "请放心。{$P$}不在时，就由我们来守护吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "50ef6dce34a4d4f1a4f84fbc8cc22441b6614fc18ff3b4480cc5d51fd0129ff2", "ja": "えへへ、私、留守番は得意なんですよ！\n妹と弟たちがいるから、力がモリモリ湧いてきますし！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我很擅长看家哦！\n因为有妹妹和弟弟们在，力量源源不断地涌出来呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "71de0f625079ae8009f27a85b60fbfd8f3722642bff5275e4cd4f8ee8638ccb6", "ja": "あー、私もアニキが家におったから、留守番いうたら\n不安っちゅーより、楽しみやったかなぁ。", "zh": "啊～我家也有老哥在，所以说到看家，\n与其说是感到不安，不如说是挺期待的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "289182879fe8472628d0d808563a13df0373bc15744f2b7bf416c3544801bfd1", "ja": "そうですわね。わたくしも子どもの頃に、\n兄とふたりで店番を……。", "zh": "是啊。我小时候也曾和哥哥两个人一起看店……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1026_038chz", "source_sha256": "3691cda0eb4dc53ea5e1b00df02bf72320242de5b5c9915f929b198e6dc2fcf3", "ja": "ではなく！　館の留守を任されることがありましたから\n慣れたものですわ。おほ、おほほほ……。", "zh": "不是！我以前也有过替宅邸留守的时候，所以早就习惯了。呵、呵呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "1c06931cd5cb12d51f77032637c1df5ceed4c329928d0ff5ec3a46eab8a075c4", "ja": "そっか。私は一人っ子だから、兄弟とか姉妹と一緒に\nお留守番はしたことなくて……なんだか羨ましいです。", "zh": "原来如此。我是独生女，所以还没和兄弟姐妹一起留在家里看过家……总觉得有点羡慕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1028_008tak", "source_sha256": "4376b5a52951ab11aeeba9c6f0dfd44032186c59dd8671ba984a47abefa7183d", "ja": "……では、この機会にいかがですか？\n百合子は私の……いいえ、私達の妹のようなもの。", "zh": "……那么，要不要趁这个机会试试看？\n百合子就像是我的……不，是我们大家的妹妹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1029_008tak", "source_sha256": "a594b17e822133b18a09f4a9de5d68773b70999a08eab9a5a3a81362b4965c75", "ja": "よければ私を姉と思って、頼りにしてください。\n私も百合子を妹と思って……頼りにしていますから。", "zh": "如果你愿意，就把我当作姐姐，依靠我吧。\n我也把百合子当作妹妹……一直依靠着她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "936b641f26f089f8f82d331db8d134ba09ea68ec762238dbfb4b6cf2ecf0cdab", "ja": "た、貴音さん……！　はぁ～……♪", "zh": "贵音前辈……！　哈啊～……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_117_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_117_1031_p", "source_sha256": "bf27ef38914579efbdd06f0b84579a2e1bc42668235b46f9c2a7f1b000435ebb", "ja": "（このメンバーの実力と、仲間同士の絆があれば、\n『ミリ音』もこなせるだろう……頼んだぞ、みんな！）", "zh": "（有了这些成员的实力，以及伙伴之间的羁绊，应该能完成《ミリ音》吧……拜托你们了，大家！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
